invariant: INV-53
file: .github/workflows/nightly.yml
catches: test/lint-matrix.sh
reason: merge-reach-table loses its if: always(), so GitHub skips it when
  a proof-reach part fails or runs out of time. Those are the nights when
  the table must name the part that did not report. lint-matrix requires
  always() in the if: of each job that needs a sharded job.

--- old
    needs: proof-reach
    # Also after a part fails or runs out of time: those are the nights
    # when the table must say which part is missing.
    if: always()
--- new
    needs: proof-reach
